New-Item -Path .gitignore -ItemType File
code .gitignore
```

**Paste this in `.gitignore`:**
```
# Environment variables (NEVER push to GitHub!)
.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python

# Virtual environment
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Streamlit
.streamlit/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log